&lt;h3 id='umanitoba-spring-2026-hpc-and-cloud-computing-workshop' class="title is-flex is-align-items-center mt-4 is-3"&gt;UManitoba Spring 2026 HPC and Cloud computing workshop&lt;a href='#umanitoba-spring-2026-hpc-and-cloud-computing-workshop' class='anchor'&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
