&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Walkthrough to install a code repository service based on &lt;a
 href="https://forgejo.org/"
 class="is-pretty-link"&gt;Forgejo&lt;/a
&gt;
.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This tutorial assumes you already have a working &lt;a
 href="https://www.debian.org/releases/bookworm/"
 class="is-pretty-link"&gt;Debian 12&lt;/a
&gt;
 virtual machine with a public IP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some useful links:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arbutus (legacy) - &lt;a
 href="https://arbutus.cloud.computecanada.ca/"
 class="is-pretty-link"&gt;https://arbutus.cloud.computecanada.ca/&lt;/a
&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud on DRAC Wiki - &lt;a
 href="https://docs.alliancecan.ca/wiki/Cloud"
 class="is-pretty-link"&gt;https://docs.alliancecan.ca/wiki/Cloud&lt;/a
&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud Quick Start on DRAC Wiki - &lt;a
 href="https://docs.alliancecan.ca/wiki/Cloud_Quick_Start"
 class="is-pretty-link"&gt;https://docs.alliancecan.ca/wiki/Cloud_Quick_Start&lt;/a
&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id='install-forgejo' class="title is-flex is-align-items-center mt-4 is-2"&gt;Install Forgejo&lt;a href='#install-forgejo' class='anchor'&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update the system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo apt update
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo apt -y upgrade&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol start="2"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install dependencies (and some utilities)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo apt -y install vim tmux net-tools dnsutils git git-lfs postgresql postgresql-client nginx certbot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol start="3"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a &lt;code&gt;git&lt;/code&gt; user&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo adduser --system --group --disabled-password --shell /bin/bash --home /opt/git git&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol start="4"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Download &lt;a
 href="https://forgejo.org/"
 class="is-pretty-link"&gt;Forgejo&lt;/a
&gt;
 from the &lt;a
 href="https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/releases"
 class="is-pretty-link"&gt;release page&lt;/a
&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo wget -O /opt/git/forgejo https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/releases/download/v15.0.2/forgejo-15.0.2-linux-amd64
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo chown git:git /opt/git/forgejo
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo chmod +x /opt/git/forgejo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol start="5"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create required directories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo mkdir -p /etc/forgejo /var/lib/forgejo
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo chown git:git /etc/forgejo /var/lib/forgejo
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo chmod &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;750&lt;/span&gt; /etc/forgejo /var/lib/forgejo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol start="6"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create the database&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo -iu postgres -- psql -c &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;CREATE ROLE forgejo WITH LOGIN PASSWORD &amp;#39;forgejo&amp;#39;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo -iu postgres -- psql -c &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;CREATE DATABASE forgejo WITH OWNER forgejo&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol start="7"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Download the Systemd service file&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo wget -O /etc/systemd/system/forgejo.service https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/raw/branch/forgejo/contrib/systemd/forgejo.service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo sed -i -e &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;s|=/usr/local/bin/forgejo|=/opt/git/forgejo|&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; /etc/systemd/system/forgejo.service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo sed -i -e &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;s|HOME=/home/git|HOME=/opt/git|&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; /etc/systemd/system/forgejo.service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo systemctl daemon-reload
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo systemctl enable forgejo.service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol start="8"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create the TLS certificate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo systemctl stop nginx.service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo certbot certonly --standalone -n --agree-tos --register-unsafely-without-email -d CHANGE_THIS.cloud.computecanada.ca&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol start="9"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure Nginx&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo rm /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/default
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo touch /etc/nginx/sites-available/forgejo
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo ln -s /etc/nginx/sites-available/forgejo /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/forgejo
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo vim /etc/nginx/sites-available/forgejo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Copy the following configuration inside &lt;code&gt;/etc/nginx/sites-available/forgejo&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Object storage example - Potree</title><link>https://um-grex.github.io/docs/training/workshops-2026/openstack-object-storage/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://um-grex.github.io/docs/training/workshops-2026/openstack-object-storage/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id='introduction' class="title is-flex is-align-items-center mt-4 is-2"&gt;Introduction&lt;a href='#introduction' class='anchor'&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Walkthrough to create a static website using Arbutus cloud object storage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This tutorial assumes you already have access to an Arbutus cloud project and you have installed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;the &lt;a
 href="https://pypi.org/project/python-openstackclient/"
 class="is-pretty-link"&gt;python openstack client&lt;/a
&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;the &lt;a
 href="https://s3tools.org/s3cmd"
 class="is-pretty-link"&gt;s3cmd tool&lt;/a
&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a
 href="https://nodejs.org/"
 class="is-pretty-link"&gt;NodeJS&lt;/a
&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a
 href="https://git-scm.com/"
 class="is-pretty-link"&gt;Git&lt;/a
&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All the required software is available on Grex as modules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some useful links:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arbutus (legacy) - &lt;a
 href="https://arbutus.cloud.computecanada.ca/"
 class="is-pretty-link"&gt;https://arbutus.cloud.computecanada.ca/&lt;/a
&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud on DRAC Wiki - &lt;a
 href="https://docs.alliancecan.ca/wiki/Cloud"
 class="is-pretty-link"&gt;https://docs.alliancecan.ca/wiki/Cloud&lt;/a
&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud Object Storage on DRAC Wiki - &lt;a
 href="https://docs.alliancecan.ca/wiki/Arbutus_object_storage"
 class="is-pretty-link"&gt;https://docs.alliancecan.ca/wiki/Arbutus_object_storage&lt;/a
&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id='deploy-a-potree-website' class="title is-flex is-align-items-center mt-4 is-2"&gt;Deploy a Potree website&lt;a href='#deploy-a-potree-website' class='anchor'&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
